    "body": "It seems that list conflicts with [webkit](https://webkit-search.igalia.com/webkit/rev/b7187fae5a43d9cddeaf6bff95451c418c744c4e/Source/WebInspectorUI/UserInterface/Models/CSSKeywordCompletions.js#863) and [blink](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/devtools-frontend/src/front_end/core/sdk/CSSMetadata.ts;l=1072-1087;drc=bbcc5a3d8cb1e989bc780abd1db58edc387c2517) implementations, it seems they don't overlap and MDN is right about it?\r\n\r\n>```js\r\n>   '-webkit-mask-composite': {\r\n>     values: [\r\n>       'clear',\r\n>       'copy',\r\n>       'source-over',\r\n>       'source-in',\r\n>       'source-out',\r\n>       'source-atop',\r\n>       'destination-over',\r\n>       'destination-in',\r\n>       'destination-out',\r\n>       'destination-atop',\r\n>       'xor',\r\n>       'plus-lighter',\r\n>     ],\r\n>   },\r\n>```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
