    "updated_at": "2021-08-02T17:44:46Z",
    "body": ">document what Gecko does, or keep this as a simple alias\r\n\r\nI think those two options are same given that Gecko implements it as a simple alias. There at least should be a note that the aliased -webkit-mask-composite is incompatible with webkit/blink implementation (although then I'm not sure why the alias should even exist).",
